    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-harming-australians-act-2015-sch-1-sec-12",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "12 After subsection 115.2(1) of the Criminal Code",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-harming-australians-act-2015#sch-1-sec-12"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-harming-australians-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-harming-australians-act-2015.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) If the conduct constituting an offence against subsection (1) was\nengaged in before 1 October 2002, the offence is punishable on\nconviction by:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00163\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 163, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Harming Australians) Act 2015\n\n(a) if, at the time the conduct was engaged in, the offence\nmentioned in paragraph (1)(e) was punishable on conviction\nby imprisonment for a term of less than 25 years—a\nmaximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of not more\nthan that term; or\n\n(b) otherwise—a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term\nof not more than 25 years.\n\n(1B) If the conduct constituting an offence against subsection (1) was\nengaged in on or after 1 October 2002, the offence is punishable on\nconviction by a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of\nnot more than 25 years.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1A) If the conduct constituting an offence against subsection (1) was\nengaged in before 1 October 2002, the offence is punishable on\nconviction by:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00163\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 163, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Harming Australians) Act 2015\n\n(a) if, at the time the conduct was engaged in, the offence\nmentioned in paragraph (1)(e) was punishable on conviction\nby imprisonment for a term of less than 25 years—a\nmaximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of not more\nthan that term; or\n\n(b) otherwise—a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term\nof not more than 25 years.\n\n(1B) If the conduct constituting an offence against subsection (1) was\nengaged in on or after 1 October 2002, the offence is punishable on\nconviction by a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of\nnot more than 25 years.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-harming-australians-act-2015-sch-1-sec-12-ss-1a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-harming-australians-act-2015-sch-1-sec-12-ss-1b"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-harming-australians-act-2015#sch-1-sec-12",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12 After subsection 115.2(1) of the Criminal Code",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) If the conduct constituting an offence against subsection (1) was\nengaged in before 1 October 2002, the offence is punishable on\nconviction by:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00163\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 163, 2015\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Harming Australians) Act 2015\n\n(a) if, at the time the conduct was engaged in, the offence\nmentioned in paragraph (1)(e) was punishable on conviction\nby imprisonment for a term of less than 25 years—a\nmaximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of not more\nthan that term; or\n\n(b) otherwise—a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term\nof not more than 25 years.\n\n(1B) If the conduct constituting an offence against subsection (1) was\nengaged in on or after 1 October 2002, the offence is punishable on\nconviction by a maximum penalty of imprisonment for a term of\nnot more than 25 years."
    },
